   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "True, but it means it's worth@taking a dangerous gamble for.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "If we could use that thing at will, it might reshape@the balance of power in the galaxy, not just <Zovorg>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Oh my, you mean to use it yourself?",
