   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "No, I'm fine.@My head just feels strangely clear...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "...What about Tenia and Melua?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Learning the truth was a shock, but...@they've calmed down and are resting now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "You and Katia included, you're all stout of heart.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "...What about Katia and Melua?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "You and Tenia included, you're all stout of heart.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "...What about Katia and Tenia?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "You and Melua included, you're all stout of heart.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "That's... because we're with the Steel Dragons.@Even after finding out we're half Earthling, half Fury,@they still accepted us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "That's not enough to surprise us anymore.@We've got Alchemie and Glacies, after all.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "I'm not even human to begin with.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "If they look the same as us,@I stopped caring. Right, Yuuki?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "I suppose. Surprises even me.",
