   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Next to Miss Black Panties over there,@even I am normality itself, don't you know.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Jumping out of a Gespenst to fight isn't@something a normal woman can do.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Anyway,@there's nothing to worry about, Touya.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "I appreciate you saying that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "Still...@to think that princess was the girl in your dreams.@She's a real beauty, isn't she?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Hmm, so that's your type, Akimi?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Ah, no, that's not what I meant.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "...In any case, her story was full of surprises.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Yes... I've heard the theory that aliens visited Earth@in ancient times, but to think they'd been sleeping@inside the Moon for thousands of years...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "And just as we thought, <Fabula Foresse>@was built by the Fury...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "But they closed the Cross Gate in the past,@so why did they leave it alone during@<The Sealing War>?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Wasn't it because the South Pole was@covered by the <Ruina> barrier?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Clifford",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Before that, the Fury must have noticed@the moment <Re-Tech> reached@Fabula Foresse.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Yeah... They could've stopped my old man@when he tried to open the Cross Gate.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Either they couldn't stop it for some reason,@or they knew and let it happen.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "(If it's the latter...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Gilliam, did you report Princess Shana-Mia@to your superiors?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Yes, to Lieutenant General Jacob Moore.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "What did the Lieutenant General say?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Tell no one, Commander Miles included...@and draw out more information from the Princess@here aboard this ship.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "(That's right... I have to ask Shana-Mia@about Al-Van...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "How cautious.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Yes... Her existence is bound to shake@the situation to its core from here on.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Kurogane Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "Captain, how do things look on the Moon?",
