  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "They must be that confident in their defenses.@Besides this ship, there are few ways@to attack beneath the Moon.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "But they're all but holding the lunar cities hostage.@I expected them to resort to some kind of threat...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "We have the Fury princess and the@Granteed Dracodeus in our hands.@Perhaps they're watching how things go?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Either way, it'll be hard to contain@Gaw-La Furia with this ship alone.@We need to join up with the Steel Dragons...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Operator",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Gravity quake detected!@Five o'clock, elevation 20! Range 6!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "So they've moved. But it's some distance off.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "The ES Wave Pattern is Zovorg!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Not the Fury, then. Captain, intercept.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Yes, sir. All hands, level-one battle stations!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Kinaha",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Iradoya, we've warped to the target coordinates.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Well then, shall we head ouuut?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "So, Kinaha dear. Would you go on ahead?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Huh? In the briefing, you were supposed to@go first, Iradoya...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "You've had more blunders than wins, Kinaha dear,@so it's time you got some results, hm?@Gomoudokka may not look it, but he's harsh, you know?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Ugh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "Ahaha, I'm kiddiiing, kidding.@It's fine even if you fail this time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "(This woman...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Oh my? Already got a bite?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Identification complete! A Zeranio-class Carrier@and Zovorg mobile weapons!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "Any Gadisword units?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "None sighted!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Captain, I'm launching.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Yes, sir. Good luck out there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Ahaha, if it isn't the Kurogane!@You sure know how to draw them, Kinaha dear.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "(Are you saying this is my fault...?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Well, I'm off to the colony,@so be a dear and hold the enemy back.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Do your so-so best, Kinaha dear.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Only the Golaikunru bunch...@No Captain Vort or Bilgo, huh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Aren't they after <Ariard> too?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Then I'd think they'd warp in closer.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "True...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Dyna 2 to all units. Commence attack.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Rätsel, sir,@half the enemy may be heading for@the colony in the L4 area.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Then send a warning to <Elpis>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Dyna 2 to all units,@stop the enemies heading for the L4 area.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Don't let them reach the edge of the combat zone. Out.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Enemy units are leaving the combat zone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "Damn, the operation's failed!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "Ngh!@I-I have no intention of dying in a place like this!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Oh deeear, they pushed us back.@Well, I was told to keep it moderate,@so let's call it here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "Oh deeear, I'm the only one left.@Well, I was told to keep it moderate,@so let's call it here.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "All enemy signals in the combat area are gone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "So we stopped the enemy's advance on the colony...@Send a report to Elpis.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Good work, Rätsel, sir.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Captain, how's the colony?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "They went on high alert after our warning,@but they haven't been attacked.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Then that group earlier@wasn't a diversion...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Rätsel...@Orders just came in from Lieutenant General Jacob.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "The Hagane and Hiryu Custom will be coming up to@space shortly. We're to join them immediately.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "That's sudden. Did something happen?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "Yeah...@Apparently there are signs of a <Cross Gate Burst>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  }
 ]
